priority: 8
on-arrival: e21_kag_done = 1; kag_exists = 1

= The Communist Working Group

Levi's supporters have left the party, or been pushed out of it. Ernst Däumig, Adolph Hoffmann, Otto Brass, Curt Geyer, Paul Malzahn and a group of Reichstag deputies form the **Kommunistische Arbeitsgemeinschaft**, the Communist Working Group, around Levi. They say they are still communists, against Moscow's emissaries and against putschism. They have a newspaper, a Reichstag group and friends in the metalworkers' union.

[? if e21_levi_fate = 4 : They are few: Levi left almost alone, after a victory, and most of his friends stayed. ?][? if e21_levi_fate != 4 : In the districts, members who agreed with Levi are deciding whether to follow. ?]

- @rank_and_file: Win back the rank and file, not the leaders.
- @renegades: Denounce them as renegades.
- @talks: Offer the KAG joint work.

@rank_and_file
subtitle: The Right's way. Patient, and it keeps most of the waverers.
on-arrival: {!
var f = (Q.e21_levi_fate == 4) ? 0.99 : 0.93;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= f;
}
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 4;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Party organisers visit every member who has stopped paying dues. Most are not interested in Levi; they are tired, or out of work. Many come back.

@renegades
view-if: offensive_gone = 0
subtitle: The Left's way. Clear lines, and more members lost.
on-arrival: {!
var f = (Q.e21_levi_fate == 4) ? 0.97 : 0.89;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= f;
}
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 6;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 6;
Q.unity += 3;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

The Rote Fahne calls the KAG a bridge back to the SPD for deserters. Every member who has doubts is invited to cross it. Thousands do.

@talks
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Spartacist way: treat them as comrades in a different room.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any deal with Levi's group.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
var f = (Q.e21_levi_fate == 4) ? 0.99 : 0.94;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= f;
}
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 8;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 8;
Q.independence += 3;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
!}

The Zentrale proposes joint work in the unions and the Reichstag. Levi accepts, coolly. Moscow asks why we are negotiating with a man the International has expelled.
